br.p:
Pub. L. 103–428, §1(c), Oct. 31, 1994, 108 Stat. 4376
, as amended by 
Pub. L. 105–121, §4, Nov. 26, 1997, 111 Stat. 2529
; 
Pub. L. 109–438, §4, Dec. 20, 2006, 120 Stat. 3269
; 
Pub. L. 112–122, §24, May 30, 2012, 126 Stat. 364
; 
Pub. L. 112–136, §1, June 21, 2012, 126 Stat. 385
; 
Pub. L. 114–94, div. E, title LIV, §54001(b), Dec. 4, 2015, 129 Stat. 1768
, provided that: "The amendments made by this section [amending this section] shall remain in effect during the period beginning on the date of enactment of this Act [Oct. 31, 1994] and ending on the date on which the authority of the Export-Import Bank of the United States expires under section 7 of the Export-Import Bank Act of 1945 (12 U.S.C. 635f)."
